# Git commits

When creating git commits in this repository:

- **Never** add `Co-authored-by:` (or `Co-Authored-By:`) trailers naming Cursor, Cursor Agent, or any `@cursor.com` address.
- **Never** pass `--trailer "Co-authored-by: Cursor ..."` (or similar) to `git commit`.
- Commit messages must list only human authors the user explicitly requests.

If a commit hook rejects a message, rewrite it without Cursor co-author lines and retry.
